{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/d4ee216db3d0b3bbcae141f1feac7ea4.poster.avif?t=1774486663\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/d4ee216db3d0b3bbcae141f1feac7ea4.webm?t=1774486663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/d4ee216db3d0b3bbcae141f1feac7ea4.mp4?t=1774486663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a card that leads you to the victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw, add or burn the cards and shuffle decks to find it.\u00a0Lucky Heroes is a very simple game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various characters &amp; strategies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/8a564f25b60089b894b150db3cab3fa2.poster.avif?t=1774486663\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/8a564f25b60089b894b150db3cab3fa2.webm?t=1774486663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/8a564f25b60089b894b150db3cab3fa2.mp4?t=1774486663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 20 playable characters that have different strategies for victory. There's a <strong>plague Doctor</strong> who spreads the poison to your deck, a <strong>fisherman</strong> who reeled the victory card up and also a <strong>mage</strong> who burn every card you have regardless of what they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normally in Lucky Heroes, your deck will be randomly made in every round depends on the character's level you are playing. All you have to do is just focus on newly made decks every single round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Heroes supports local play. Since the decks are not open to all players, two players can play with one device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect and play everywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Heroes will support multi-platform. You can interlock the play data from one device to another.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1281320?t=1774486663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1281320?t=1774486663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/79dee2bbe00c3bf31aee0423dee272377cf6c486/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774486663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/79dee2bbe00c3bf31aee0423dee272377cf6c486/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774486663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1315060,"description":"Beta Version"}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/d4ee216db3d0b3bbcae141f1feac7ea4.poster.avif?t=1774486663\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/d4ee216db3d0b3bbcae141f1feac7ea4.webm?t=1774486663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/d4ee216db3d0b3bbcae141f1feac7ea4.mp4?t=1774486663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a card that leads you to the victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw, add or burn the cards and shuffle decks to find it.\u00a0Lucky Heroes is a very simple game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various characters &amp; strategies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/8a564f25b60089b894b150db3cab3fa2.poster.avif?t=1774486663\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/8a564f25b60089b894b150db3cab3fa2.webm?t=1774486663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/8a564f25b60089b894b150db3cab3fa2.mp4?t=1774486663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 20 playable characters that have different strategies for victory. There's a <strong>plague Doctor</strong> who spreads the poison to your deck, a <strong>fisherman</strong> who reeled the victory card up and also a <strong>mage</strong> who burn every card you have regardless of what they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normally in Lucky Heroes, your deck will be randomly made in every round depends on the character's level you are playing. All you have to do is just focus on newly made decks every single round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Heroes supports local play. Since the decks are not open to all players, two players can play with one device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect and play everywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Heroes will support multi-platform. You can interlock the play data from one device to another.</p>","developers":["Sinkhole Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/ccfd7d04b741ed6c30433b64600247bbf28280be/header.jpg?t=1774486663","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1281320/2044684978/6ce5425dae787519d8f34d7fd2e93bb96956c75b/1757902542/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757915822","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1281320/2044684978/6ce5425dae787519d8f34d7fd2e93bb96956c75b/1757902542/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757915822","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1281320/2044684978/6ce5425dae787519d8f34d7fd2e93bb96956c75b/1757902542/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757915822","id":257197796,"name":"Alpha Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257197796/cf8598b7cfcd4253e8003dda498c550f67f92846/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757915822"}],"name":"Lucky Heroes","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.2Ghz or faster Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB Dedica